n elevation pattern; single flat shadows look amateurish.",[228,994,995,981,997,1000],{},[978,996,980],{},[33,998,999],{},"border-radius: 50%"," on a square for a circle — it's the modern way to make circular avatars\u002Fbadges without SVG. On a rectangle, it makes an ellipse.",[228,1002,1003,1005,1006,1008,1009,1012],{},[978,1004,980],{},": animate a pseudo-element's opacity for shadow transitions — animating ",[33,1007,360],{}," directly repaints each frame (janky). Instead, a ",[33,1010,1011],{},"::after"," with the hover shadow, opacity 0 → 1, is cheaper and smoother.",[228,1014,1015,981,1017,905,1019,1022,1023,1025,1026,1028],{},[978,1016,980],{},[33,1018,889],{},[33,1020,1021],{},"border",") for focus indicators — outlines don't affect layout (no shift when focus appears), and ",[33,1024,893],{}," adds a gap. Never remove ",[33,1027,889],{}," without a replacement; it's an a11y violation.",[18,1030,1032],{"id":1031},"️-edge-cases-gotchas","⚠️ Edge Cases & Gotchas",[225,1034,1035,1053,1061,1080,1096,1114,1126,1144,1155,1164],{},[228,1036,1037,57,1043,1046,1047,1049,1050,1052],{},[978,1038,1039,1042],{},[33,1040,1041],{},"border-style: none"," (default) means no border",[33,1044,1045],{},"border-width: 2px"," alone does nothing — the style is ",[33,1048,170],{},". Always set a style (",[33,1051,103],{},", etc.) for the border to appear.",[228,1054,1055,1060],{},[978,1056,1057,1059],{},[33,1058,360],{}," doesn't affect layout",": it's painted outside the box and doesn't take space. A large shadow can overlap neighboring elements without pushing them.",[228,1062,1063,1072,1073,1075,1076,1079],{},[978,1064,1065,1067,1068,1071],{},[33,1066,360],{}," is clipped by ",[33,1069,1070],{},"overflow: hidden"," ancestors",": a child's shadow extending outside an ",[33,1074,1070],{}," parent is cut off. Use ",[33,1077,1078],{},"overflow: clip"," (no scroll container) or restructure.",[228,1081,1082,1089,1090,1092,1093,1095],{},[978,1083,1084,1086,1087],{},[33,1085,889],{}," doesn't follow ",[33,1088,273],{}," (in most browsers): the outline is rectangular even on a rounded box. Modern browsers are fixing this, but for rounded focus rings, use ",[33,1091,360],{}," as the focus indicator or ",[33,1094,1021],{}," (which shifts layout).",[228,1097,1098,57,1105,1107,1108,1110,1111,1113],{},[978,1099,1100,1102,1103],{},[33,1101,908],{}," vs ",[33,1104,823],{},[33,1106,908],{}," matches both keyboard and mouse focus; ",[33,1109,823],{}," matches keyboard only (and programmatic focus in some browsers). Use ",[33,1112,823],{}," to avoid showing focus rings on mouse click.",[228,1115,1116,1122,1123,1125],{},[978,1117,1118,1119,1121],{},"Removing ",[33,1120,889],{}," without a replacement is an a11y violation",": keyboard users lose the focus indicator. Always provide an alternative (a ",[33,1124,360],{}," ring, a background change, etc.).",[228,1127,1128,1137,1138,1140,1141,259],{},[978,1129,1130,1132,1133,800,1135],{},[33,1131,748],{}," has no ",[33,1134,250],{},[33,1136,803],{},": unlike ",[33,1139,360],{},". Only ",[33,1142,1143],{},"offset-x offset-y blur color",[228,1145,1146,1151,1152,259],{},[978,1147,1148,1150],{},[33,1149,999],{}," on a non-square makes an ellipse, not a circle",": for a circle, the element must be square (equal width and height), or use ",[33,1153,1154],{},"aspect-ratio: 1",[228,1156,1157,1160,1161,1163],{},[978,1158,1159],{},"Shadows are expensive to animate",": animating ",[33,1162,360],{}," repaints the shadow each frame. For hover effects, animate a pseudo-element's opacity instead.",[228,1165,1166,1174,1175,1177,1178,1180],{},[978,1167,1168,1170,1171],{},[33,1169,1021],{}," on a table cell with ",[33,1172,1173],{},"border-collapse: collapse",": borders are merged; the higher-priority style wins (",[33,1176,258],{}," > ",[33,1179,170],{}," > others by width).",[18,1182,1184],{"id":1183},"spot-the-bug","🧠 Spot the Bug",[14,1186,1187],{},"A developer removes the default focus outline and adds a custom one, but keyboard users can't see where focus is on buttons:",[23,1189,1190],{"language":25},[27,1191,1193],{"className":29,"code":1192,"language":25,"meta":31,"style":31},"button { outline: none; }\nbutton:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px blue; }\n",[33,1194,1195,1210],{"__ignoreMap":31},[36,1196,1197,1199,1201,1203,1205,1207],{"class":38,"line":39},[36,1198,820],{"class":287},[36,1200,492],{"class":46},[36,1202,889],{"class":53},[36,1204,57],{"class":46},[36,1206,170],{"class":53},[36,1208,1209],{"class":46},"; }\n",[36,1211,1212,1214,1216,1218,1220,1222,1224,1227,1229,1231,1233,1235],{"class":38,"line":50},[36,1213,820],{"class":287},[36,1215,908],{"class":42},[36,1217,492],{"class":46},[36,1219,360],{"class":53},[36,1221,57],{"class":46},[36,1223,499],{"class":53},[36,1225,1226],{"class":53}," 0",[36,1228,1226],{"class":53},[36,1230,543],{"class":53},[36,1232,64],{"class":63},[36,1234,190],{"class":53},[36,1236,1209],{"class":46},[14,1238,1239],{},"What's the issue?",[1241,1242,1243,1247,1250,1285,1293,1355,1367],"details",{},[1244,1245,1246],"summary",{},"Answer",[14,1248,1249],{},"Two problems:",[1251,1252,1253,1267],"ol",{},[228,1254,1255,1260,1261,1263,1264,1266],{},[978,1256,1257,1259],{},[33,1258,908],{}," shows the shadow on mouse clicks too"," — the developer probably intended keyboard-only, but ",[33,1262,908],{}," matches mouse clicks. After clicking a button, the shadow ring appears, which is usually unwanted. Use ",[33,1265,823],{}," for keyboard-only.",[228,1268,1269,1275,1276,1278,1279,1281,1282,1284],{},[978,1270,1271,1067,1273,1071],{},[33,1272,360],{},[33,1274,1070],{}," — if the button is inside an ",[33,1277,1070],{}," container, the 2px shadow ring is clipped, and keyboard users can't see it. ",[33,1280,889],{}," (and ",[33,1283,893],{},") isn't clipped the same way.",[14,1286,1287,1288,264,1290,1292],{},"The fix — use ",[33,1289,823],{},[33,1291,889],{}," (or ensure the shadow isn't clipped):",[27,1294,1296],{"className":29,"code":1295,"language":25,"meta":31,"style":31},"button { outline: none; }  \u002F* remove default, but provide a replacement *\u002F\nbutton:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid blue;\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n",[33,1297,1298,1315,1323,1339,1351],{"__ignoreMap":31},[36,1299,1300,1302,1304,1306,1308,1310,1312],{"class":38,"line":39},[36,1301,820],{"class":287},[36,1303,492],{"class":46},[36,1305,889],{"class":53},[36,1307,57],{"class":46},[36,1309,170],{"class":53},[36,1311,959],{"class":46},[36,1313,1314],{"class":76},"\u002F* remove default, but provide a replacement *\u002F\n",[36,1316,1317,1319,1321],{"class":38,"line":50},[36,1318,820],{"class":287},[36,1320,823],{"class":42},[36,1322,47],{"class":46},[36,1324,1325,1327,1329,1331,1333,1335,1337],{"class":38,"line":80},[36,1326,830],{"class":53},[36,1328,57],{"class":46},[36,1330,60],{"class":53},[36,1332,64],{"class":63},[36,1334,67],{"class":53},[36,1336,190],{"class":53},[36,1338,92],{"class":46},[36,1340,1341,1343,1345,1347,1349],{"class":38,"line":95},[36,1342,847],{"class":53},[36,1344,57],{"class":46},[36,1346,60],{"class":53},[36,1348,64],{"class":63},[36,1350,92],{"class":46},[36,1352,1353],{"class":38,"line":108},[36,1354,217],{"class":46},[14,1356,1357,1358,1360,1361,1363,1364,1366],{},"::\nOr if using ",[33,1359,360],{},", ensure no ",[33,1362,1070],{}," ancestor clips it, or use ",[33,1365,889],{}," which isn't clipped.",[14,1368,1369,981,1372,905,1374,1376,1377,343,1379,1381,1382,1384,1385,1387],{},[978,1370,1371],{},"The lesson",[33,1373,823],{},[33,1375,908],{},") for keyboard-only focus rings, and prefer ",[33,1378,889],{},[33,1380,893],{}," (not clipped by ",[33,1383,1070],{},") for the focus indicator. Never remove ",[33,1386,889],{}," without a visible replacement — keyboard users depend on it.",[18,1389,1390],{"id":1244},"Summary",[14,1392,1393,1394,264,1396,1398],{},"You can now style borders (style\u002Fwidth\u002Fcolor\u002Fradius, per-side, elliptical), box-shadows (offset\u002Fblur\u002Fspread\u002Finset, layered elevation), text-shadows, and outlines (focus states with ",[33,1395,823],{},[33,1397,893],{},") — while avoiding the layout-shift and clipping traps. Next: animations and transitions.",[1400,1401,1402],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sIsaT, html code.shiki .sIsaT{--shiki-default:#6F42C1;--shiki-github-dark:#B392F0}html pre.shiki code .ssxIu, html code.shiki .ssxIu{--shiki-default:#24292E;--shiki-github-dark:#E1E4E8}html pre.shiki code .snvgF, html code.shiki .snvgF{--shiki-default:#005CC5;--shiki-github-dark:#79B8FF}html pre.shiki code .svdQ7, html code.shiki .svdQ7{--shiki-default:#D73A49;--shiki-github-dark:#F97583}html pre.shiki code .sdCPZ, html code.shiki .sdCPZ{--shiki-default:#6A737D;--shiki-github-dark:#6A737D}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .github-dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-github-dark);background: var(--shiki-github-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-github-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-github-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-github-dark-text-decoration);}html.github-dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-github-dark);background: var(--shiki-github-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-github-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-github-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-github-dark-text-decoration);}html pre.shiki code .sk71V, html code.shiki .sk71V{--shiki-default:#22863A;--shiki-github-dark:#85E89D}html pre.shiki code .sMKGj, html code.shiki .sMKGj{--shiki-default:#B31D28;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-github-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-github-dark-font-style:italic}",{"title